  "id": "USN-9113-1",
  "summary": "lilypond vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that LilyPond did not restrict the embedded-ps and\nembedded-svg commands when running in safe mode. If a user or automated\nsystem were tricked into processing a specially crafted file in safe mode,\nan attacker could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code.",
